mwebd-kmp packages github.com/ltcmweb/mwebd for Android and Desktop JVM.

Android uses an in-process gomobile runtime. Desktop JVM distributions use an
authenticated native sidecar built from the same pinned Go sources.

Upstream mwebd:
https://github.com/ltcmweb/mwebd

Pinned upstream version:
github.com/ltcmweb/mwebd v0.1.19

The source distribution also contains the pinned local neutrino fork used by
mwebd. Its license is preserved at go/mwebdandroid/third_party/neutrino/LICENSE.
